  "description": "Double Peak 27.5 Expert utilizes a low stand over, low center of gravity designed Boost frame made from proprietary lightweight X6 alloy, an internal head tube, and internal cable routing. DP Expert, features a lightweight and versatile 1 X 11 speed XT/SLX combo drive train. Upgraded U-28 32 hole alloy wheelset with Pivit sealed bearing thru axle hubs, and nicely finished with Kenda Honey badger 27.5\" x 2.2\" tires. Leading the way is a RockShox Judy Gold RL Boost suspension fork with 100mm of buttery travel. Experts lightning fast speed is easily tamed courtesy of Shimano's M-500 hydraulic disc brakes.\nDouble Peak X6 Series alloy Boost frame w/ smooth welding\nNew RS Judy Gold RL Boost fork, 100mm travel, Solo air\nShimano SLX 1x Boost crankset, 32T Alloy Chainring\nShimano XT Shadow Plus rear derailleur\nShimano SLX 11-46T 11-spd cassette\nShimano SLX 11-spd right shifter\nNew Shimano M500 hydraulic disc brakeset\nKenda Honey Badger XC 2.2\" tires\nPivit alloy Light handlebar & stem\nPivit sealed bearings thru-axle hubs\nWTB Ace Dual Clamps grips",
